---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lang = 'en' as const;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | New Business Light sarl"
  description="How New Business Light sarl handles information submitted through this website."
  lang={lang}
  canonicalPath="/en/privacy"
>
  <section class="bg-navy-950 py-14 lg:py-16">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="bg-white py-14 lg:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-6 px-4 text-base leading-7 text-coolgray-700 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p><em class="text-sm text-coolgray-500">This policy is a working draft and should be reviewed by NBL management before production launch.</em></p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy">Information we collect</h2>
      <p>Through the RFQ form and direct contact, we collect the details you choose to submit: company name, contact person, email address, phone number, location, and the description of your supply requirement, together with any attachments.</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy">How we use it</h2>
      <p>Submitted information is used only to review your requirement, prepare a commercial offer and coordinate the related supply. It is not sold or shared with unrelated third parties.</p>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-navy">Your choices</h2>
      <p>To review or remove information you have submitted, contact us at info@newbusinesslight.com.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
